+/*
+ * The record that the boot-time analytics handlers fill in.  The
+ * completeBoot() method copies these fields into the IOAnalyticsBoot
+ * CoreAnalytics event.
+ */
+
+/*
+ * All fields are absolute values collected since boot: the times are
